          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "*As a* Shopper, \n*I want* to see prices displayed consistently in my local currency across every surface of the site, \n*so that* I always see the correct price regardless of where I am browsing.\n\nThe PWA must render the correct currency and price drawn from the SFCC pricebook consistently across: PLP, PDP, cart, wishlist, recommended product tiles, order history, and checkout.\n\nThis is a PWA Kit frontend story. Currency display formatting rules (symbol, decimal places, separators) are configured in BM per [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-46|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-46|smart-link]. \nCountry-to-currency mapping is configured per [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-44|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-44|smart-link]. This story ensures the PWA applies those rules consistently across all surfaces.\n\n\n\nReference Image (Figma is leading)\n\n!image-20260901-052147.png|width=329,alt=\"image-20260901-052147.png\"!\n\n!image-20260901-052244.png|width=198,alt=\"image-20260901-052244.png\"!",
          "to_string": "*As a* Shopper, \n*I want* to see prices displayed consistently in my local currency across every surface of the site, \n*so that* I always see the correct price regardless of where I am browsing.\n\nThe PWA must render the correct price consistently across: PLP, PDP, cart, wishlist, recommended product tiles, order history, and checkout. The price source is either the SFCC pricebook for that storefront and currency, or — where no SFCC pricebook exists for the shopper's currency — the Global-e converted price derived from the base pricebook.\n\nThis is a PWA Kit frontend story. Currency display formatting rules (symbol, decimal places, separators) are configured in BM per [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-46|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-46|smart-link]. \nCountry-to-currency mapping is configured per [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-44|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-44|smart-link]. This story ensures the PWA applies those rules consistently across all surfaces.\n\n\n\nReference Image (Figma is leading)\n\n!image-20260901-052147.png|width=329,alt=\"image-20260901-052147.png\"!\n\n!image-20260901-052244.png|width=198,alt=\"image-20260901-052244.png\"!"
        }
