        {
          "field": "Acceptance Criteria",
          "fieldtype": "custom",
          "to_string": "# Given a Shopper's country is mapped to a specific currency, when they view a product tile on the PLP, then the price is displayed in the correct currency with the correct formatting.\n# Given a Shopper views a PDP, when the price renders, then the same price and formatting is shown as on the PLP product tile.\n# Given a Shopper views the cart, when line items and order summary render, then all prices are displayed in the correct currency with consistent formatting.\n# Given a Shopper views their wishlist, when product tile prices render, then the correct currency and formatting is applied.\n# Given a Shopper views recommended product tiles, when prices render, then the correct currency and formatting is applied.\n# Given a Shopper views their order history, when order amounts render, then prices are shown in the currency that was active at the time of order.\n# Given a Shopper proceeds to checkout, when prices render throughout the checkout flow, then the correct currency and formatting is applied consistently.\n# Given the formatting rules for a currency are updated in BM, when the storefront renders prices, then the updated formatting is reflected across all surfaces without a code deployment.",
          "to_id": ""
        }
      ],
